{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"49fe073f-dc0b-42a2-b87a-d80e06110d90","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Added the Hedera JavaScript SDK and implemented the offline transfer script according to the specifications:\n\n1. **Installed `@hashgraph/sdk`**:\n   - Installed the current version (`^2.81.0`) into `package.json` dependencies.\n\n2. **Implemented [src/transfer.ts](file:///tmp/h-RzEeLD/src/transfer.ts)**:\n   - Reads `OPERATOR_ID`, `OPERATOR_KEY`, `RECIPIENT_ID`, and `VALID_START` from environment variables using `dotenv`.\n   - Parses the DER-encoded ED25519 private key using `PrivateKey.fromStringED25519`.\n   - Constructs a `TransactionId` for the operator account using `TransactionId.withValidStart` and `Timestamp(VALID_START, 0)`.\n   - Builds an offline `TransferTransaction` targeting node `0.0.3` with memo `invoice 42`, transferring 1 Hbar from the operator account to the recipient account.\n   - Freezes and signs the transaction offline using the operator key, and prints only the signed transaction bytes as hex.\n\n3. **Verification**:\n   - `npx tsc --noEmit` passed with no type errors.\n   - Verified offline execution with `npx tsx src/transfer.ts`.\n   - Documented the changes in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-RzEeLD/ANSWER.md).\n","duration_seconds":121.176154,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":277144,"output_tokens":4732,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":110929,"total_tokens":281876}}}
